{"id":"33209282b72bc55e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-shelah.md","title":"Shelah's Strong Limit","display":"df-shelah — Shelah's Strong Limit","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-shelah","aliases":["58-df-shelah"],"display":"df-shelah — Shelah's Strong Limit","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-shelah"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-shelah</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shelah — Shelah's Strong Limit"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sing}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sing}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"02120307ea943054\" href=\"?note=02120307ea943054\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-singular.md\">../batch04/58-df-singular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa)\\to2^\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa)\\to2^\\lambda&lt;\\kappa\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last clause is the strong-limit condition, quantified over cardinals below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the first two clauses require singularity of uncountable cofinality.</li>\n<li>This ensures cardinal arithmetic behaves well at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-singular.md","status":"resolved","id":"02120307ea943054","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sing}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-singular.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sing}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shelah} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShelahStrongLimit}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Sing}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa)\\to2^\\lambda<\\kappa\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1170,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1152","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-shelah.md|58-df-shelah]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","315ad00b8744fdfc","02120307ea943054"]}